# PHASE 3: PROJECT DESIGN

## System Flow

Spreadsheet
↓
Import Set Table
↓
Transform Map
↓
Employee Test Table
↓
Reports
↓
Employee Analytics Dashboard

## Database Design

### Employee Test Table

**Table Name:** Employee Test
**Backend Name:** u_employee_test

| Field         | Type   |
| ------------- | ------ |
| Employee ID   | String |
| Employee Name | String |
| Email         | String |
| Department    | String |
| Location      | String |

## Import Table

**Label:** Employee Import
**Backend Name:** u_employee_import

The Import Set table works as the staging area before the data is transferred to the target Employee Test table.

## Transform Map Design

**Name:** Sample Spreadsheet Import

**Source:** Employee Import

**Target:** Employee Test

The source fields are mapped to their corresponding target fields.
